OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APretending to be in New Zealand,
OL,4,Abooking leave and buying consoles - the
OL,5,Alengths fans are going to for GTA 6
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe has her alarm set for 05:00 GMT,
OL,8,Fand has a day off booked. She says she
OL,9,Fput the game's release on her leave
OL,10,Frequest form which was approved, she
OL,11,Ftold BBC News, despite the fact her
OL,12,Fboss "doesn't know what GTA 6 is".
OL,14,FShe's far from the only one. For the
OL,15,Fgame's launch day, HR software company
OL,16,FBrightHR looked at absence data from
OL,17,Fmore than 1.2 million employees from
OL,18,F70,000 businesses across the UK.
